  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scoping mission to improve Djibouti&#x2019;s Law Enforcement and justice cooperation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Justice Development expert, Patrick Stevens of IJD Ltd will travel to Djibouti, working with HMG and UNDP and local CJS stakeholders and agencies in the capital and the regions, identify and analyse current practices and in particular the strengths and weaknesses that revealed. A workshop to discuss emerging findings will be held in country and a report delivered on return with recommendations for potential interventions for both the UK and UNDP, which would deliver strategic improvement and be capable of being incorporated into the UNDP Rule of Law programme or delivered as stand alone projects.</narrative>
  </description>
